nl_statement_of_codex:
Let $F:J\to C$ be a functor and let $t$ be a cocone over $F$. If $t$ is a colimit, then for any cocone $s$ and any morphism $f':s.X\to X'$, the diagram
$$\require{AMScd}
\begin{CD}
t.X @>{t.ι.app j}>> s.X\\
@V{self.desc s}VV @VV{f'}V\\
s.X @>{s.ι.app j}>> X'
\end{CD}$$
commutes.

